{"version":1,"content":"<p>據央視財經消息，格力電器董事長董明珠近日與格力技校學生面對面交流，談及技能培養、就業去向及學校運營等話題。在《對話》節目現場，董明珠表示，三年後想留下的學生，基本都能留在格力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586406.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.846872+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:23:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_hash":"94d76a23827414173cd9d6f7eb47804cbcd1d05f327ef528d498bd134fa15aef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}